1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,700
Comunidad Fuerte. Safe first. The right authority. Money only for verified work.

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:13,700
Neighbors arrive first. When sargassum piles up on a beach, the people who live there have no safety plan, no expert, and no way to raise money that donors trust.

3
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:20,700
Report what you see. A short interview with photos and simple answers. Any phone, and it works offline.

4
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:27,700
Check and send. No account, no name needed.

5
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:36,700
Rules set the floor. Code sets the minimum safety level. Claude reads the photos and can make it stricter, never weaker.

6
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:43,700
Steps anyone can follow. Protection, short shifts, children away. Mexico's own safety colours.

7
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:50,700
Ten languages. Maya and Nahuatl use paid community interpreters, never machine translation.

8
00:00:51,300 --> 00:01:00,700
Laws by level. International, national, state and local. Only verified rules, with source and date.

9
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:07,700
A link for the authority. The office needs no account.

10
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:14,700
The office answers in the app. It sees the report without the resident's name or contact details.

11
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:22,700
In progress, and a pledge. Case number, date, and a promise to match every community dollar 1:1, up to $300.

12
00:01:23,300 --> 00:01:29,700
The answer comes back. Every answer goes into the tamper-evident record.

13
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:37,700
Neighbors donate. Donations through PayPal go to this incident only.

14
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:46,700
An agent invoices the match. The PayPal Agent Toolkit invoices exactly what is owed. It can never send money out.

15
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:53,700
Money in milestones. The crew uploads a photo.

16
00:01:54,300 --> 00:02:01,700
Claude checks the evidence. No photo, no payment.

17
00:02:02,300 --> 00:02:09,700
A named person approves. Then PayPal Payouts pays. A verifier can never pay themselves.

18
00:02:10,300 --> 00:02:16,700
Private by design. Only the reporter sees the report.

19
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:24,700
A public ledger. Every dollar, without places, photos or names.

20
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:31,700
Anonymous statistics. Groups smaller than 3 are hidden.

21
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:38,700
Open to download. Every anonymous total as CSV.

22
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:46,700
Strong communities. Safe first, the right authority, and money only for real work.
